WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.513
In this video, one session starts four more,

2
00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:10.798
one for each direction the PM team asked for.

3
00:00:10.798 --> 00:00:13.938
This is a real run, with the waits sped up.

4
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.799
The PM team's follow-up is fictional too.

5
00:00:19.799 --> 00:00:22.715
After talking with customers, they want to see

6
00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:25.758
four very different
toolbars before they commit.

7
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.613
Minimal and calm. Playful and
expressive. Dense for power users.

8
00:00:31.613 --> 00:00:33.855
And big and touch friendly.

9
00:00:38.692 --> 00:00:41.309
The prompt uses the variations skill.

10
00:00:41.309 --> 00:00:44.775
It asks for four sessions
under this one, each on

11
00:00:44.775 --> 00:00:48.241
its own branch, adding
only its own toolbar file.

12
00:00:52.817 --> 00:00:57.912
When all four are done, it puts them
together in one lab you can switch between.

13
00:01:03.107 --> 00:01:05.979
The four sessions start,
nested under this one in

14
00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:08.792
the Sessions list,
all working at the same time.

15
00:01:11.173 --> 00:01:13.760
Next, we'll steer them while they build.
